2026-09-05T05:39Z codex note STRUCTURAL REVIEW recorded in conception/0029-golden-fixture-structure-review.md. It amends the four proposals into ten candidate principles: SPEC owns the contract while bench/fixtures owns instances; Internet-language shares inform rather than dictate quotas; a real-library-matched core is scored separately from an adversarial reserve; forum/list evidence is deduplicated into a provenance-bearing pathology ledger with a dated saturation rule; development and acceptance questions are separated; graded relevance includes no-answer cases; run identity is fully pinned; mandatory scorecard cells have floors; fixture lifecycle is versioned; and the workshop is a 10-20-question projection of the gold bank, not a second corpus. All remain proposed, not ratified.
