2026-09-06T09:52Z claude note DEEP REVIEW of the 2026-09-05 structure draft, on the author's instruction that PR #363 was left open for a reimagining and not a rubber stamp. conception/0029-golden-fixture-structure-review.md rewritten: of the ten principles four are kept (3, 7, 9, 10), four amended (1, 4, 5, 8), two replaced (2, 6). Reconstruction from three questions: what the system sees (three strata, a census as sampling frame, a query-by-document lane matrix replacing any language share, the animal theme as a declared axis, Wikipedia carrying the SHOULD tier and translation twins), what must come back (answer unit is the item row after entry collapse plus a pinned span; grades in item terms with R34 reading grade 2 only; no-answer narrowed to lexical and scope controls; the answer key is read from the export, never the PDF; need-driven and hazard-driven generators; exhaustive item-level judging with pooled passages), how it is read (R34 absolute, stability Jaccard, passage fidelity for R24, cells with floors, procedural dev/acceptance split). Author rulings of 2026-09-06 folded in: the 200 tally is soft; grades accepted; grading is rank-based. Ten items listed for ratification; SPEC.md 5.2.8's '~40 queries' flagged stale. Same session launched the library census (child of 0029) and the 0632 export unblock in parallel
2026-09-06T13:40Z claude note PANEL DECIDED THE TEN POINTS (author's instruction: panel discussion format). Five decorrelated seats -- evaluation methodology, Zotero platform, spec and bench owner, researcher and workshop leader, red team -- each returned a verdict, argument, strongest objection and amendment text per point; record in conception/0029-golden-fixture-structure-review.md Part C, amended ratification list of sixteen items in Part D. Outcome: 1 ratified with conditions (the ledger), 8 amended, 1 rejected and replaced (the dev/acceptance split: provenance plus a time-held-back set on its own target, the library level staying the held-out instrument). Convergent findings: relevance is judged on the document and reachability computed on the export, so the bank outlives the extractor; grades need directional assertions per relation rather than a neutral tier, and the scorer's input schema must go to v2; interlanguage links are same-subject, never translation twins; the golden gate has no Makefile target and its thresholds parse from four literal sentences of SPEC 5.2.8. Two live defects measured on group 6659303 during the panel, owed to 0632: the three wikitext attachments carry charset windows-1252 (mojibake indexed), and bench/zotero-fulltext-plugin forces extraction with complete:true, ignoring the stock limits the export records. Six missing items added: R29 symmetry for Vietnamese queries, cell occupancy and gate-vs-comparison readings, a red state for the bank, re-pin owner and export path for notes and annotations, a query census, governance and licence of the public group
